{"qid": "b04", "family": "b", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "According to the Rosemount 3051 datasheet (rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001, p. 77), for the Rosemount 3051CFC_C Compact Orifice Flow Meter with Conditioning Option C, Ranges 2-3, a beta ratio of 0.50 gives a flow reference accuracy of ±1.95% of flow rate at 8:1 flow turndown.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [77, 43, 53, 105, 29, 28, 45, 57, 106, 104, 98]}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [36]}], "latency_s": 1.7571091999998316, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 11864, "completion_tokens": 164, "cost_usd": 0.00079548, "spent_usd": 0.00079548, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 77, "score": 0.7671}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 43, "score": 0.7346}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 53, "score": 0.7075}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 105, "score": 0.7034}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 29, "score": 0.6887}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 28, "score": 0.6784}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 45, "score": 0.6415}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.6338}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 57, "score": 0.6276}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 106, "score": 0.627}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 104, "score": 0.6241}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 98, "score": 0.6117}], "prompt_chars": 33508, "reply": "{\"answer\": \"According to the Rosemount 3051 datasheet (rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001, p. 77), for the Rosemount 3051CFC_C Compact Orifice Flow Meter with Conditioning Option C, Ranges 2-3, a beta ratio of 0.50 gives a flow reference accuracy of ±1.95% of flow rate at 8:1 flow turndown.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
{"qid": "b05", "family": "b", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "glm", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "glm", "final": {"answer": "Yes. GV-1-2 is covered by the Georg Fischer Type 165 2/2-way solenoid valve datasheet (gfps-165-solenoid-valve), which lists a 'Service-friendly, robust manual override' as a feature, so the valve can be operated manually without power. Note that with circuit function A the valve is normally fail-safe to close (FC), so the manual override would be needed to open it when de-energized.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [36, 1, 3]}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "pages": [1, 3, 4]}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "pages": [42, 34, 47, 98]}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "pages": [10, 1]}], "latency_s": 2.1340424999943934, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 11460, "completion_tokens": 253, "cost_usd": 0.00075168, "spent_usd": 0.00075168, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 0, "models": ["qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b", "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 36, "score": 0.679}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 1, "score": 0.5949}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 3, "score": 0.594}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 42, "score": 0.5761}, {"document_id": "gfps-165-solenoid-valve", "page": 4, "score": 0.5742}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 34, "score": 0.5624}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 1, "score": 0.5586}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 10, "score": 0.5533}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 3, "score": 0.5528}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 1, "score": 0.5487}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 47, "score": 0.5465}, {"document_id": "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001", "page": 98, "score": 0.5447}], "prompt_chars": 31865, "reply": "{\"answer\": \"Yes. GV-1-2 is covered by the Georg Fischer Type 165 2/2-way solenoid valve datasheet (gfps-165-solenoid-valve), which lists a 'Service-friendly, robust manual override' as a feature, so the valve can be operated manually without power. Note that with circuit function A the valve is normally fail-safe to close (FC), so the manual override would be needed to open it when de-energized.\", \"not_present\": false}"}}}
